#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:5
#: f1522be84933401ca13d2cc8f1b987a2
msgid "Tuning Turn Rate"
msgstr "转向速率调参"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:7
#: 677e2ac159b14ca88f9b011b597a24ff
msgid ""
"This page describes how a Rover's Turn Rate controller (aka steering rate "
"controller) can be tuned.  This is the most important controller to tune in "
"order to achieve good steering control."
msgstr "本页介绍如何调节 Rover 的转向速率控制器（又称转向速率控制器）。这是实现良好转向控制最重要的控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:13
#: be6b83c6d78a468c9bb91c7fd9db80e9
msgid "Turn Rate PID Tuning"
msgstr "转向速率 PID 调参"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:15
#: 1ca95860f3fc4b31b733118dc2063b04
msgid ""
"The Turn Rate controller attempts to achieve the desired turn rate (set by "
"the pilot or autopilot) using a PID controller.  All modes except :ref:`Hold"
" <hold-mode>` and :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` use this controller."
msgstr ""
"转向速率控制器使用 PID 控制器来实现飞手或自动驾驶仪设定的目标转向速率。除 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` 和 "
":ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` 外，所有模式均使用此控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:17
#: f15ed9943b6e4a708c5fba251278fc18
msgid ""
"The FF, P, I and D gains for this controller are held in the "
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_FF <ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`, :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_P "
"<ATC_STR_RAT_P>`, :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_I <ATC_STR_RAT_I>` and "
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_D <ATC_STR_RAT_D>` parameters respectively."
msgstr ""
"该控制器的 FF、P、I 和 D 增益分别存储在 :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_FF "
"<ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`、:ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_P <ATC_STR_RAT_P>`、:ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_I "
"<ATC_STR_RAT_I>` 和 :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_D <ATC_STR_RAT_D>` 参数中。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:19
#: da3448f17ad24cfdbc3f218c99baa7e1
msgid "Recommended steps for tuning this controller are:"
msgstr "调参推荐步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:21
#: 9a57a39670094f02a83351f63563649f
msgid "Connect the ground station to the vehicle using a telemetry radio"
msgstr "通过数传电台将地面站与车辆连接"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:22
#: 44e17cd9d061476e8bfc3d566da72640
msgid ""
"Set the :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>` parameter to be roughly what "
"the vehicle's maximum turn rate is in deg/sec.  For a more precise "
"measurement:"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>` 参数大致设为车辆最大转向速率（单位：度/秒）。如需更精确的测量："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:24
#: 5891db087e01484f907eaaca2f01791f
msgid ""
"On Mission Planner's Flight Data screen, check the \"Tuning\" checkbox "
"(bottom middle), double click on the graph and select \"gz\" (Gyro Z-axis)"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面，勾选「Tuning」复选框（底部中间），双击图表并选择「gz」（陀螺仪 Z 轴）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:25
#: 0180314f54a44b498266bc91ae3b7bbd
msgid ""
"Drive the vehicle in Manual mode at a medium speed making very sharp turns"
msgstr "在 Manual 模式下以中等速度驾驶车辆，做急转弯"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:26
#: 7e056a6d021f497e8ea857ce6f1945bf
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>` to a bit lower than the highest "
"values seen.  Note the value shown may be in centi-degrees/sec so its value "
"should be divided by 100 to match the parameter's deg/sec"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>` 设为略低于所观测到的最大值。注意显示值可能为厘度/秒，需除以 100 "
"以匹配参数的度/秒单位"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:28
#: f6acfe65b5b64595aa4babaa4e8d6107
msgid "Set the :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` to 1 (Steering)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` 设为 1（转向）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:29
#: 4364e22be1574ad4b631260e6c74a573
msgid ""
"On Mission Planner's Flight Data screen, check the \"Tuning\" checkbox "
"(bottom middle), double click on the graph and select \"pidachieved\", "
"\"piddesired\""
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner "
"飞行数据界面，勾选「Tuning」复选框（底部中间），双击图表并选择「pidachieved」、「piddesired」"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:34
#: e294c0cbd16b4559b212413e6a8490d3
msgid ""
"Drive the vehicle in :ref:`Acro <acro-mode>` at a medium speed making "
"various wide and tight turns and compare how well pidachieved follows "
"piddesired"
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`Acro <acro-mode>` 模式下以中等速度驾驶车辆，做各种宽幅和急弯，比较 pidachieved 对 piddesired "
"的跟随效果"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:35
#: e686436012584d5b843136c96551f4a7
msgid ""
"Tune the :ref:`FF gain <ATC_STR_RAT_FF>` first.  This gain converts the "
"desired turn rate directly into a steering servo or motor output.  If the "
"vehicle's turn rate response is sluggish then this parameter should be "
"increased.  If the vehicle is constantly overshooting its desired turn rate "
"then this parameter should be reduced."
msgstr ""
"首先调节 :ref:`FF 增益 "
"<ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`。该增益将目标转向速率直接转换为转向舵机或电机输出。若车辆转向响应迟钝，应增大该参数；若车辆持续超过目标转向速率，应减小该参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:36
#: ace2ea15a1ea40108b1c6d1afdcdf880
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The :ref:`P gain <ATC_STR_RAT_P>` corrects for short-term error.  It can "
"often be set to a low value (e.g. 20% of FF) if the FF value is set well.  "
"If set too high the turn rate may oscillate.  This :ref:`P gain "
"<ATC_STR_RAT_P>` should always be lower than the :ref:`FF gain "
"<ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`P 增益 <ATC_STR_RAT_P>` 修正短期误差。若 FF 值设置合理，通常可设为较低值（如 FF 的 "
"20%）。若设置过高，转向速率可能出现振荡。:ref:`P 增益 <ATC_STR_RAT_P>` 应始终低于 :ref:`FF 增益 "
"<ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:37
#: eef0e38185204780a782ca5d251e2208
msgid ""
"The :ref:`I gain <ATC_STR_RAT_I>` corrects for long-term error.  It can "
"often be set to the same value as P.  If the vehicle never achieves the "
"desired turn rate, then this parameter should be increased.  If the "
"vehicle's turn rate slowly oscillates then this parameter should be reduced."
"  This :ref:`I gain <ATC_STR_RAT_I>` should always be lower than then "
":ref:`FF gain <ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`I 增益 <ATC_STR_RAT_I>` 修正长期误差。通常可与 P "
"设为相同值。若车辆始终无法达到目标转向速率，应增大该参数；若车辆转向速率缓慢振荡，应减小该参数。:ref:`I 增益 <ATC_STR_RAT_I>` "
"应始终低于 :ref:`FF 增益 <ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:38
#: 91eaea6e8c274d0d9ad255724ca38795
msgid ""
"The :ref:`D gain <ATC_STR_RAT_D>` is meant to stabilize the output by "
"fighting against short-term changes in turn rate.  This gain can normally be"
" left at zero."
msgstr ":ref:`D 增益 <ATC_STR_RAT_D>` 用于通过抑制转向速率的短期变化来稳定输出。该增益通常可保留为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:40
#: 3fbde3a1f89246b6923b13be766ee4c4
msgid ""
"Finally set :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_MAX <ATC_STR_RAT_MAX>` to the "
":ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>` value and optionally reduce "
":ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>`.  The difference between these two "
"parameters is:"
msgstr ""
"最后将 :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_MAX <ATC_STR_RAT_MAX>` 设为 :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE "
"<ACRO_TURN_RATE>` 的值，并可选降低 :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE "
"<ACRO_TURN_RATE>`。这两个参数的区别在于："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:42
#: a587169b8ac64a9f91dc0544581eefa6
msgid ""
":ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>` controls how the pilot's input is "
"converted to a desired turn rate in Acro mode.  This parameter can be "
"reduced to make turns in Acro mode more docile for the driver"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>` 控制飞手输入在 Acro 模式下转换为目标转向速率的方式。可降低该参数以使"
" Acro 模式下的转向更为温和"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-steering-rate.rst:43
#: 1b807199f1f6433c995f21cc51468c5d
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_MAX <ATC_STR_RAT_MAX>` is the maximum turn rate that the "
"vehicle will ever attempt in any mode.  This should normally be kept close "
"to the vehicle's performance limits so the vehicle remains agile"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_MAX <ATC_STR_RAT_MAX>` "
"是车辆在任何模式下的最大转向速率。通常应保持接近车辆的性能极限，以确保车辆保持灵活性"

